          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Add reply, rebooking, goal-completion, and opt-out stops to your workflow. Verify each condition is configured correctly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Test with a Sample Contact</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Create a test contact and run through the entire sequence. Verify timing, content, personalization, links, and all stop conditions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Complete Workbook Missions 4–6</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Document your test results, note any issues found, and record your fixes. Set a 30-day review date to measure actual rebooking, referral, and next-service rates.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      true,
      7,
      NOW(),
      NOW()
    )
    RETURNING id INTO v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Created lesson: Stop, Test, and Improve';
  ELSE
    -- Update existing lesson
    UPDATE public.lessons 
    SET 
      content = '<div class="space-y-8">
  <!-- Learning Goal -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 rounded-2xl p-6 text-white shadow-lg">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Learning Goal</h3>
    </div>
    <p class="text-white/90 text-lg">Set safeguards to avoid irrelevant messages, test the complete workflow with a sample contact, and establish a review process to track real results over time.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Why Stop Conditions Matter -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-blue-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-blue-100">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Why Stop Conditions Matter</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Avoid Irrelevant Messages</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Without stop conditions, your workflow might send rebooking invitations to customers who already rebooked, or referral requests to customers who already referred someone.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Respect Customer Actions</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">If a customer takes the action you requested, they should not receive further messages asking for the same thing. Stop conditions prevent this redundancy.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Protect the Relationship</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Sending messages that do not apply to the customer''s current situation feels careless. Stop conditions show you are paying attention to their actions.</p>
