      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Module 22: Advanced Follow-Up Strategies</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
