        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Add Stop Conditions to Your Workflow</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Add reply, rebooking, goal-completion, and opt-out stops to your workflow. Verify each condition is configured correctly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Test with a Sample Contact</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Create a test contact and run through the entire sequence. Verify timing, content, personalization, links, and all stop conditions.</p>
        </div>
